{"text": "2. Subtract (1/3) from 3:", "start": 216, "end": 241, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "3 - (1/3) = (9/3) - (1/3) = (8/3)", "start": 242, "end": 275, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "3. Then multiply the result by 10:", "start": 277, "end": 311, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "10 * (8/3) = (80/3)", "start": 312, "end": 331, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "4. Finally, multiply this result by 3:", "start": 333, "end": 371, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(80/3) * 3 = 80", "start": 372, "end": 387, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "It seems that there was a mistake in the calculation sequence to directly reach 24.", "start": 389, "end": 472, "label": "inform"}
